SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ddff utility is compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”)
     specification.

     The flags [--hhiillnn], as well as the BLOCKSIZE environment variable, are ex‐
     tensions to that specification.

     This implementation provides the traditional BSD --tt behaviour, which dif‐
     fers from the X/Open System Interfaces option specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A ddff utility appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

